# Table some tennis (Mobile)

Table some tennis now on your phone!

## Instructions for Build and Use

Steps to build and/or run the software:

1. Download Table_some_tennis.apk
2. Make sure your phone allows installs, you might have to edit some setting in Google play in oder to install the app.
3. Open app and enjoy

Instructions for using the software:

1. Tap once to serve
2. Slide to move the paddle
3. It's movement based aiming

